stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NORMAL
  NORMAL --> DEGRADED: alarm, no service critical
  NORMAL --> INCIDENT: alarm with a critical service or a fact
  DEGRADED --> INCIDENT: a service turns critical
  INCIDENT --> DEGRADED: criticals recover
  DEGRADED --> RESOLVED: alarm clears
  INCIDENT --> RESOLVED: alarm clears
  RESOLVED --> [*]
